warning[unpaired_lock]: this `return` leaves `*state.mutex` locked
  --> tests/lint/unpaired_lock/bad.jai:13:21
   |
13 |     if state.closed return false;
   |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: unlock it before returning, or `defer` the unlock right after locking
   = note: `unpaired_lock` is `warn` by default

warning[unpaired_lock]: `*state.mutex` is locked here but the procedure can end without unlocking it
  --> tests/lint/unpaired_lock/bad.jai:23:5
   |
23 |     lock(*state.mutex);
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: unlock it on every path, or `defer` the unlock right after locking
   |
23 -     lock(*state.mutex);
23 +     lock(*state.mutex);
24 +     defer unlock(*state.mutex);
   |
   = note: `unpaired_lock` is `warn` by default

